WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.360
Let us proceed with
Kinoshita's remedial lessons.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:11.490
The other day, Kinoshita experienced the first step of rice cultivation: the planting.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.570
The next lesson will be on...

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.780
field farming!

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:17.740
There's heaps of crops
what get planted in fields.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.740
Which one are we gonna use?

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:21.700
Soybeans.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.330
Ah, soybeans!

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:29.040
I selected soybeans partly because they are suited to beginners,

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.920
but their greatest appeal
is undoubtedly their versatility.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.930
Miso, soy sauce, tofu, natto, soy milk, soybean flour, simmered soybeans...

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.010
You can also eat them as
bean sprouts or edamame.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:42.640
Edamame are made from soybeans?

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:43.560
That's right!

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:47.060
Soybeans are often called
"the meat of the fields",

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.820
so rich in nutrients they are.

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:55.110
they've found valuable
applications in numerous fields.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.280
They're all the rage!

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.210
When will they sprout?

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:12.130
Soybeans grow pretty quickly.

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:13.170
After school?

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.920
That would be frightening.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:18.260
Ten to fourteen days, in general.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.180
All right! Let's get farming!

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:27.690
<i>Where there is light, there is shadow.</i>

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:29.600
<i>Where there is soil, we plant crops.</i>

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>Indeed, in the shadows of farming dwell
countless agriculture and forestry students.</i>

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.400
<i>Amidst this all, we find Ringo, sowing soybeans!</i>

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.580
We're plum outta miso!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.420
Can someone go fetch some more?

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.110
You mean from Bio E?

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:16.080
Yeah.

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.590
Bio E?

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:19.710
The Bioengineering Department.

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:22.470
That's class B, which is next door to us.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.890
By the way, the "B"
there stands for "Bio".

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.930
Miso is important and all...

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:28.520
but Bio E...

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.600
Their class rep gives me the creeps.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:32.640
How come?

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:33.980
For one, those eyes.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.420
Looking down on us like we're insects

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:38.690
or just staring at us funny.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:42.570
Then fleeing the moment
we respond to their gaze.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:45.490
Out of revulsion, you'd think,
yet the stare remains.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.700
Truly an enigma.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.660
Well that's all mighty fine,

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:52.290
but there ain't gonna be no miso soup tonight if'n we don't got miso.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.080
That would suck, but...

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.080
Kousaku, let us go together.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:03:59.000
Shall we go?

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:00.760
Let's go!

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:01.420
Let's go!

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.220
<i>And that's how that happened.</i>

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.140
It's up here, right?

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:09.970
If memory serves.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:11.390
You don't know for sure?

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:14.390
R-Ringo?

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:15.400
Why are you...

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.770
I've never been here. I was curious.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.280
Oh yeah. This is your first time
coming up this way.

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:25.360
Actually, we've never been
in here before either.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:29.370
There's a lot of stuff in here.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.950
They conduct their studies
very differently from how we do.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:36.880
Do they use all the equipment in here? Dang.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.130
That's the power of Bio!

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:43.730
You're Suzuki Akari!

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:46.340
Also known as Bio Suzuki!

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.750
So glad you could make it.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:49.800
Minorin told me to expect you.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:51.850
Nobody at Tamo Agricultural

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:55.140
is more perverse, eccentric, or has
stranger powers than the Four Farm Deities!

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.100
I didn't expect to be
welcomed by one of them.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:01.110
Why, it's only natural.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.110
Class A's representative, his best friend,

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.070
and the famous transfer student deserve a proper reception!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.700
Come, help yourselves

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.490
to as much miso as you want!

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.120
It smells nice.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.330
But of course.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:19.210
Our miso is aged and fermented
from only the finest organic soybeans.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:21.000
Soybeans...

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.760
Try it on cooled, whole cucumbers!

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:25.920
It's simply exquisite!

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.050
Let's hurry back.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:28.970
Oh, right.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:29.930
You must be feeling hungry.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.680
Very well. You have our gratitude.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.310
One moment!

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.770
As long as you're here, would you be so kind as to do me a favor?

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.230
A favor?

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.150
What kind?

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:42.270
Oh, you know...

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.190
Human experimentation?

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.530
No thank you!

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.030
I jest.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.620
As a matter of fact, we've recently developed a new product.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.910
It would be lovely
if you'd assist me in testing it.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.120
Oh? So what have you created?

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.000
A <i>Lactobacillus</i>!

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:58.280
<i>Lactobacillus</i>?

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.870
That's the stuff in yogurt?

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.000
That's right.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.630
It's bacteria that produces lactic acid.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:07.010
Tamo Agricultural's Bioengineering Department has developed a new plant-derived strain.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.220
Plant-derived?

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:11.470
Yogurt is made from milk. Isn't that animal-derived?

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:14.810
You're a heavy-duty dullard,
aren't you, Hata-kun?

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.350
<i>Lactobacilli</i> can be found in rice bran pickles,

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:21.730
in miso, and in the very air around us!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:22.810
We've named ours...

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:23.940
You've named it...?

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:26.320
ANaL BB!

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:31.740
All Natural Life science Bio, type B,

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.870
or ANaL BB for short!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.290
Oh, phew.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.200
Here I thought you'd invented some skin care cream—

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:39.540
I thought it meant buttsex.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.370
Way to be subtle!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:46.460
Anyway, Suzuki, what precisely will we be testing with ANaL?

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:50.340
I'd like to investigate its properties.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:53.550
This is a yogurt sample that was made using ANaL BB.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.580
Sweet, so we just gotta taste-test it?

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:59.680
You're a dullard of astronomical proportions, Hata-kun.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:02.230
<i>This</i> yogurt is not
meant for consumption.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:03.650
This here...

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.110
is yogurt that you spray!

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:08.030
Yogurt that you spray?

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:08.860
It's not for eating?

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:12.470
If you spray crops with yogurt
or other <i>Lactobacillus</i> products,

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:17.160
it can kill pests and nurture their growth. Haven't you heard?

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.950
The lack of theoretical
evidence aside...

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:22.710
With that in mind, I'd like you to test it for me!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.750
Well, you <i>did</i> give us miso...

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.210
We can hardly refuse.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.130
In that case,

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.090
let's do it.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:30.050
Let's do it.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.180
<i>And that's how that happened.</i>

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.680
S-So why are we shirtless?

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.600
We wouldn't want you getting yogurt on your clothes.

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:44.440
Take these and <i>squirt</i>
all over each other!

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.020
Kinoshita-san, feel free to simply observe.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.610
Your skin is already so silky smooth.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:53.800
Ready?

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:55.280
I'm coming, Kousaku.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.450
Ready.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:57.990
Come quickly, Kei.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.130
Incidentally, why are
you photographing us?

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.710
You know, that's a good question.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.000
You dullard!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.270
Dullard! Dullard!
You absolute dullard!

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:13.970
Scientists are duty-bound
to record their experiments!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.800
Now go on! Keep squirting
all over each other!

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:18.480
Sure...

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:22.730
Cut!

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.060
Bio!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:31.180
Bio! Bio! Bio!

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:27.700
Why?

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.440
Why didn't you squirt on his glasses?

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.230
Have some sense or GTFO!

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.910
You're clearly supposed to aim for the lens and fire your load!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.070
Hurry up and redo their make-up!

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.740
Bio!

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.590
Um, is this <i>really</i>
a biology experiment?

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:43.460
It looks more like
we're filming a movie.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.540
I don't mind
being watched.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.330
I mind being
admired even less!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.050
All right, in your positions.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:53.970
YuYu Hunk-show, scene 1, take 2!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.430
Stop!

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:56.980
Now hold it right there!

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:59.030
What's with that lawsuit-bait title?

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:00.510
Kei, back me up here!

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:04.140
I'll show you my power at 80%!

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.390
What are you saying?!

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:10.730
So you're one of <i>them</i>.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:11.610
A rotten fujoshi!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.820
I prefer "Fermented Maiden"!

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.910
That means the same thing
as "rotten", doesn't it?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.070
You dullard!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:20.580
Fermentation and rotting
couldn't be more different!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.200
The process is essentially the same!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:27.290
Wai—

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.790
Kei, where did your pants go?!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.210
G-G-Get away!

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.630
Why are you panting?

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:45.310
Basking in the afterglow?!

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:47.480
An excellent take.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:51.310
As thanks, I'll let you in
on a little something.

00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:53.440
Let me... in?

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:55.960
F is on the move.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.150
Be careful.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:01.200
F... is...

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:08.540
Zip, zip, zoom!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.130
Kousaku!

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.590
Whatcha doin'?

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.630
Y-You idiot, Minori! We're in danger!

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.010
We got impatient.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.470
Yeesh, Ringo!

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.760
Do you understand the situation we're in?

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.520
And what situation might that be?

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:30.480
There is a class that begets
nothing but the fires of war.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.650
That class is governed by the Law of War.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:38.820
Therein lies the predecessor of the Tamo Agricultural we know—

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.910
a department with over
a hundred years of history!

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:42.910
That class is known as...

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:43.370
F!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.370
F?

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.290
Right! The "F" in "Class F" stands—

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:51.750
Never insult a Woodman!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.170
You!

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:59.220
One of the Four Farm Deities, Class F's representative,

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:01.930
Miyamoto Woodman Rintarou!

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:04.220
You messed with the wrong guy!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:09.270
Let's take this to the mountaintop.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.560
I don't remember the
last time I was this pissed.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:14.940
Huh?

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.650
Why at me?

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:18.360
Nothing makes my blood boil

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:23.700
more than punks like you who can talk to chicks like it's nothing!

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:27.330
The "F" in "Class F" stands for "Forest".

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:31.830
Forestry Engineering is the most warlike and rugged class at Tamo Agricultural.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:35.880
We face death in a hundred practical classes before we graduate.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.170
We live in the mountains for half of each school year.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.800
We're men among men!

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.720
The men of the forest! Woodmen!

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:46.180
It's exhaustin' just bein'
around that guy.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.140
Then there's you punks!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:51.100
Planting your sissy cucumbers and eggplants!

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:54.020
And with two ch-chicks fawning over you!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.100
That's bullshit!

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:57.070
Didn't one join your department this year?

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.820
She beat it ages ago!

00:11:59.390 --> 00:12:00.860
But you, Class A!

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:02.650
It's bad enough that you monopolized—

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:05.570
no, <i>class</i>-opolized the
mega-cutie transfer student!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.660
But worst of all,

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:09.990
you went wild over her despite already being blessed with Nakazawa-san!

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:11.660
Blessed... with Minori?

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:10.920
Yes?

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:12.370
Caring!

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.040
Friendly!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:13.620
Curvy!

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:14.370
Childhood friend!

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:15.790
Excellent cook!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.710
Truly the ideal wife!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:20.920
Why are you hitting on the transfer student
when you have <i>her</i>?!

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.930
Sh-Shucks, really?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:26.010
Miyamoto-kun's got an eye for quality!

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:29.730
Hey, man, Kousaku-kun, man.

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:32.960
Did you and Nakazawa-san really b-ban—

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:37.770
bathe together until the
e-end of m-middle school?

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.730
What are <i>you</i> on?
That's obviously BS!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:44.240
No kidding! Of all the crazy rumors...

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.110
We stopped second
semester of second year!

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:48.030
Destroy!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.530
Wait! Wait! Let me explain!

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:54.210
S-See, my mom's passed on,

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:57.290
What's it to me?

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.960
S-So Minori's family took me in...

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.130
So then what?

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:04.510
I-It would have taken too long to bathe one at a time.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.880
So us and her three sisters...

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:11.060
You're telling me... you bathed with four chicks?

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:11.850
Yeah.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.430
All right.

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:14.230
Kill him!

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.850
Hang on! Hang on! Hang on!

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.900
We're still talking middle school here!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.730
Minori here was a real late bloomer.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.900
She was about as curvy as a trout back then!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:22.980
Hey, Kousaku!

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.860
Ain't you ever heard of manners?

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.320
I was just telling the truth!

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:29.700
Y-Yeah, but it ain't true no more! Check these knockers!

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.660
If you believe it, I guess it's true.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:33.660
At least in your little world.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:36.250
Ooh, you're gettin' on
my nerves somethin' fierce!

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:37.040
You asked for it!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:39.380
I'm gonna bathe with you tonight!

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:43.920
Seein' as my body's too modest to give you any funny ideas!

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.760
W-Well yeah, I guess so.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.390
I'll finally get to scrub yer back again.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.560
No thanks!

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:53.680
Now, now.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:56.270
Someone's gotta wash
where you can't reach.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:14:00.150
You just return the favor, 'kay?

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:00.940
I know!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.190
We can face each other
and scrub at the same time!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:07.570
The sweetness! It's too much!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.660
Kou...saku.

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.120
Is it true you bathed together?

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:19.080
You were joking... right?

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.500
Rin-chan!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.960
Wh-What in tarnation?
What happened?

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.420
Rin-chan's Achilles' heel is triangles!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.730
Kousaku-kun, my man.

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:33.140
Y-Yeah?

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:36.970
There was a time when I fantasized

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:39.060
of sitting next to a girl.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.820
You don't need to tell me.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:47.190
If I wait, I'll be waiting forever.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.570
The same goes for a mountain.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.280
You'll never reach the summit if you don't climb yourself.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.700
So I swore to myself,

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:00.460
that I'd make the Forestry
Engineering Department, Class F,

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.000
a popular class for girls.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.840
H-How?

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:06.590
It's simple.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:07.210
Yes?

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.470
Forest girl fashion!

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.930
The F in "Class F" stands for "Forest"!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:20.770
It's hip, it's fresh, it's trendy with youth!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:22.770
Forest girls are where it's at!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:26.400
Naw, that fad peaked ages ago.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:27.400
Better lurk more.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:28.650
That's older than "all your base".

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:29.530
Shaddap!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.780
The long and short of it is, we need girls!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.200
So we can sit next to them in class,

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.780
borrow their textbooks when we "forget" ours,

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:38.580
drop our erasers and "accidentally" brush fingers as we pick them up,

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:44.500
or stay after school together to work on a group project!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.210
The "F" in "Class F" stands for "Female"!

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:50.130
Nothing wrong with that plan,
except for everything.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:52.930
Ah, but we mustn't jump to conclusions.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:58.310
It's true that "forest girls" often get relegated to the "mysterious airhead" role.

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:03.190
However, a tough and pragmatic
new breed of girl has recently appeared.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.770
Sensei! Kamatori-sensei!

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:08.980
In short, the mountain girl!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:09.980
Mountain girl!

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:14.110
Hiking, trekking, and even rock climbing.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:16.820
Mountain climbing is now the hottest trend!

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:20.290
The "F" in "Class F" stands for Mt. Fuji!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:21.660
Let's go!

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.660
No, let's return! To the mountains!

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:30.130
Did that just resolve itself?

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.380
Looks like they fended off F.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:38.680
He's the weakest of the
Four Farm Deities anyway.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:41.180
Led astray by mere feminine temptation.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.770
They do besmirch our reputation.

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:04.370
Hey baby, it's teatime.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.130
Huh?

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.130
That's funny. She's not here yet?

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:16.090
This <i>was</i> when we agreed to meet, right?

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:19.720
Huh?

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.810
Man, I was sure she'd be here.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.810
I-It can't be!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.560
Seventeen.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:31.940
Ah, how lovely.

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:34.360
It's so... <i>bellissimo</i>.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.780
'Tis a wonderful age.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.660
Aren't we the same age?

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:40.320
But I do adore the number seventeen.

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:43.290
Eleven, thirteen, seventeen.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.540
The primes are such solitary numbers.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:47.870
Yet I find strength in them.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:48.830
The jig's up!

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.250
I thought it was you!

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.040
Class E's

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.460
Rose Hanazono!

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.960
Yes, I am!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:00.470
Class rep for Class E, Landscaping, and a Farm Deity.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:03.430
Famous as the hottest pretty boy on campus!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:05.180
But you've earned a place on my hit list!

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:10.310
Luring Ringo... and Young Master into your trap
is a crime of the highest order!

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:14.280
Oh, Kousaku.

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.400
Are you okay? Did he do anything funny to you?

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:19.030
No.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.870
Why didn't you come to the library?

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.030
He offered me a snack.

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:25.870
That's no reason to go off with a stranger!

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:27.460
What's the big idea here, Hanazono?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.790
I thought I warned you about messing with Class A again!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.840
Did he do something before?

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:35.760
Last year he was trying to seduce Minori!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.380
So you haven't forgotten.

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.470
Such a fond memory.

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.720
When a pretty boy like you started giving Minori attention,

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:48.890
it went to her head and she was bragging and yapping and wouldn't shut up!

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:53.730
I'll use any means
to attain what I desire.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:55.360
That is my policy.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:56.570
You see?

00:18:56.870 --> 00:19:00.530
Then I'll use whatever means necessary to protect Ringo!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.500
Then let us duel.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.160
Duel?

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:12.500
I just so happen to have some Pockin here.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.960
We'll duel with these.

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.050
Where... was he hiding those?

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.880
The rules are simple.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:20.840
We each nibble one end.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:24.430
The first to let go or snap the Pockin loses.

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:25.930
Come, Hata-kun!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:29.810
Let's play the Pockin Game, with Ringo on the line!

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:30.480
Fine!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.100
Just you watch, Ringo!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.690
I'll win this for sure!

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.120
<i>H-He's close.</i>

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.540
<i>Too close for comfort!</i>

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:56.790
<i>Wha... He's closing his eyes?!</i>

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:00.010
<i>He's playing this game in challenge mode!</i>

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.670
<i>My shivering heart!</i>

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.640
<i>And this burning heat!</i>

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.060
Halt this game at once!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.270
It seems I made it in time.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:15.480
Kousaku, get away from him
as quickly as you can!

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.530
Class E, Landscaping's rep, Hanazono Kaworu.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:20.860
Otherwise known as Rose Hanazono!

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:21.990
So named because—

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:32.790
I was too late...

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:38.290
Kou-tan, you...!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.260
<i>Merci</i>. This is excellent material!

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:42.130
Behold, world. <i>This</i> is a gay flick.

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:52.730
The one who stole your first kiss was me, Hanazono Kaworu!

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:54.100
You...

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.480
filthy imbecile!

00:20:56.480 --> 00:21:01.440
I've been waiting so, so long for this.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:02.440
Yes!

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:03.990
<i>Di molto</i> excellent!

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:05.860
Th-Then you mean...

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:07.820
that time you hit on Minori...

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:08.700
Yes.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.830
And bringing Ringo here...

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.450
Yes, I am!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.790
Cut the Engrish! That was plain illegal!

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:18.790
And why were you guys watching and not stopping him?

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:19.790
My, my.

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:23.090
I was hoping to put out a Hata-kun <i>uke</i>-extravaganza book this summer.

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:24.130
"<i>Uke</i>-extravaganza"?!

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:24.800
Hell no!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.630
We'll press on to new horizons!

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:27.680
Go back to the freaking mountains!

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.680
Kou-tan, come back to us!

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.060
I haven't gone anywhere, sheesh!

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:33.220
Say.

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:35.270
What is it, Ringo?

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:38.150
One, Bio Suzuki.

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:40.730
Two, Woodman Rintarou.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.940
Three, Rose Hanazono.

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:45.570
Yeah... so?

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:47.530
We're missing one.

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:03.210
<i>And so the fourth of the Farm Deities is about to be revealed!</i>

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:04.130
<i>Wait, we're dragging this plot on?</i>

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:06.380
<i>Last week had such
a touching ending too!</i>

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:40.220
"Fullmoe Alchemist".
